      <activity id="217fd3d1-dfb3-57c3-ba79-9d74c85c259f" activityNameId="2416c294-a692-5964-b276-625485c72135" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity, low voltage, production CENTREL, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, low voltage, production CENTREL, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from medium to low voltage as well as the distribution of electricity at low voltage.;
UUID: 2acb87c2-5e4c-33f7-b960-de99fac2e4e4
Included are the electricity production using , the transmission network as well as direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during low-voltage transmission and transformation from medium-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on Swiss data.
Technology: Average technology used to distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air- and SF6-insulated medium-to-low voltage switching stations. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Statistics for 2008
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2acb87c2-5e4c-33f7-b960-de99fac2e4e4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
